<title>SOUTH AFRICA: JSE SAYS QUALIFIES MANCHEM AUDIT OPINION.</title>
<headline>JSE SAYS QUALIFIES MANCHEM AUDIT OPINION.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange said on Wednesday that the audit opinion on Manga-Chem Products Ltd's annual financial statements had been qualified.</p>
<p>It said the company's listing on the Johannesburg Equities Trading system would be annotated with a &quot;Q&quot; with effect from October 17 to indicate the qualification.</p>
<p>The annotation would be removed when the company produced an unqualified audit opinion, the exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
